@host = http://localhost:8082

### Liste des companies
GET {{host}}/api/companies

### Un GET par id
GET {{host}}/api/companies/1

### Créer une company
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: Regis

{
  "name": "Siemens",
  "sector": "INDUSTRY",
  "city": "Munich"
}

### Créer une interaction liée à la company 1
POST {{host}}/api/interactions?companyId=1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: Regis

{
  "date": "2026-08-01",
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "summary": "Premier contact",
  "outcome": "TO_FOLLOW_UP",
  "nextActionDate": "2026-08-10",
  "nextActionNote": "Relancer"
}

### Historique d'une company
GET {{host}}/api/companies/1/history

### À relancer aujourd'hui
GET {{host}}/api/companies/to-follow-up

### Créer un sponsorship pour tester
POST {{host}}/api/sponsorships?companyId=1&eventId=1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: Regis

{
  "amount": 1500.0,
  "contributionType": "FINANCIAL",
  "status": "NEGOTIATION",
  "notes": "En discussion"
}

### Sponsors d'un événement
GET {{host}}/api/sponsorships

### Sponsors d'un événement
GET {{host}}/api/events/1/sponsorships

### Event inexistant → 404
GET {{host}}/api/events/999/sponsorships

### Budget d'un événement
GET {{host}}/api/events/1/budget

### Dashboard global
GET {{host}}/api/stats

### Company valide → 201
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: regis37

{ "name": "Bosch", "sector": "INDUSTRY", "city": "Stuttgart" }

### Company SANS nom → doit être rejetée (400)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: regis37

{ "sector": "INDUSTRY", "city": "Stuttgart" }







### Company
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: Regis

{ "name": "Siemens", "sector": "INDUSTRY", "city": "Munich" }

### Event
POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gala 2026", "date": "2026-11-15", "targetBudget": 5000.0, "description": "Gala annuel" }

### Interaction liée à la company 1
POST {{host}}/api/interactions?companyId=1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: Regis

{ "date": "2026-08-01", "type": "EMAIL", "summary": "Premier contact", "outcome": "TO_FOLLOW_UP", "nextActionDate": "2026-08-10", "nextActionNote": "Relancer" }

### Sponsorship liant company 1 et event 1
POST {{host}}/api/sponsorships?companyId=1&eventId=1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Created-By: Regis

{ "amount": 10000.0, "contributionType": "MIXED", "status": "RECEIVED", "notes": "Sponsor principal" }


## Vérification


### Historique
GET {{host}}/api/companies/1/history

### À relancer
GET {{host}}/api/companies/to-follow-up

### Budget de l'event (doit montrer secured: 10000)
GET {{host}}/api/events/1/budget

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/stats